      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Long dictation keeps listening&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dictation continues beyond five minutes while audio is saved to disk. The in-memory buffer stays bounded.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A short delay opening the audio file no longer leaves the entire dictation without a disk copy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If storage is unavailable, the retained audio is transcribed and a visible message explains why recording stopped.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
